* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* RMFL---C DECIDE in RMFL---S                                                      >
* 2015-03-25 NOMALL-1561 Code stripped,buffer problems
* SU4      2018-02-16 NOM 3.5     avoid compile error NAT7545(RMFL---C)
IF #SYM SPECIFIED AND #SYM=SCAN(#SYMBOL)
  ##STRING:=&1&
  EXAMINE #SYM #SYMBOL POSITION IN ##POS
  SEPARATE SUBSTR(#SYM,##POS) INTO &1& IGNORE WITH DELIMITER ';'
  SEPARATE &1& INTO &1& &1& IGNORE WITH DELIMITER '='
END-IF
#STRING2 := &1&
PERFORM #EXAM /*in RMFL---S
IF #SYM SPECIFIED AND #SYMBOL=SCAN(#SYM)
  &1&:=##STRING
END-IF
